{"id":"658684","name":"蘑菇焖酿豆腐","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658684/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酿豆腐","amount":"4块"},{"name":"蘑菇","amount":"200g"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买的酿豆腐，没买多，只买了四块。","img":"images/658684/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鲜蘑菇、番茄、葱，分别切好。","img":"images/658684/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用淀粉加水调一个芡汁备用。","img":"images/658684/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅热油，酿豆腐入锅煎，酿肉的那面朝下。","img":"images/658684/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"两面煎香，盛出备用。","img":"images/658684/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"接着炒蘑菇和番茄。","img":"images/658684/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量的盐，炒出汁。","img":"images/658684/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量的清水。","img":"images/658684/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入刚刚煎好的酿豆腐，盖盖焖3分钟。","img":"images/658684/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"时间到，倒入芡汁。","img":"images/658684/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入酱油调味，把汤汁收至浓稠。","img":"images/658684/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后，放入葱段，拌匀出锅。","img":"images/658684/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658684/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}